# Release configuration + changelogs — release team only.
# Anchored to the release-please-managed paths: a basename `CHANGELOG.md`
# rule would also gate the scaffold changelogs under templates/ and
# internal/template/, which release-please never writes.
/.github/release-please-config.json    @hop-top/release
/.github/.release-please-manifest.json @hop-top/release
/CHANGELOG.md                          @hop-top/release
/sdk/ts/CHANGELOG.md                   @hop-top/release
/sdk/py/CHANGELOG.md                   @hop-top/release
/sdk/experimental/rs/CHANGELOG.md      @hop-top/release
/sdk/experimental/php/CHANGELOG.md     @hop-top/release
/incubator/qmochi/CHANGELOG.md         @hop-top/release
